# Page intro alignment

On every page, breadcrumb, gold page-name eyebrow, and the main title stay **left**, in the same place as the rest of the site.

Do not put a photo, compass, or aside to the left of that intro. Side visuals go **right**. The intro must not be pushed into a right column.

On `/o-meni/`, identity (breadcrumb, O meni, name, title, credentials) is left; the portrait is right and may stay sticky while the text scrolls.
